{
  "page": 313,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2361,
      "text": "Dan Aku telah memilih engkau, maka dengarkanlah apa yang akan diwahyukan (kepadamu).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2362,
      "text": "Sungguh, Aku ini Allah, tidak ada tuhan selain Aku, maka sembahlah Aku dan laksanakanlah salat untuk mengingat Aku.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2363,
      "text": "Sungguh, hari Kiamat itu akan datang, Aku merahasiakan (waktunya) agar setiap orang dibalas sesuai dengan apa yang telah dia usahakan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2364,
      "text": "Maka janganlah engkau dipalingkan dari (Kiamat) oleh orang yang tidak beriman kepadanya dan oleh orang yang mengikuti keinginannya, yang menyebabkan engkau binasa.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2365,
      "text": "\"Dan apakah yang ada di tangan kananmu, wahai Musa?\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2366,
      "text": "Dia (Musa) berkata, \"Ini adalah tongkatku, aku bertumpu padanya, dan aku merontokkan (daun-daun) dengannya untuk (makanan) kambingku, dan bagiku masih ada lagi manfaat yang lain.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2367,
      "text": "Dia (Allah) berfirman, \"Lemparkanlah ia, wahai Musa!\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2368,
      "text": "Lalu (Musa) melemparkan tongkat itu, maka tiba-tiba ia menjadi seekor ular yang merayap dengan cepat.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2369,
      "text": "Dia (Allah) berfirman, \"Peganglah ia dan jangan takut, Kami akan mengembalikannya kepada keadaannya semula,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2370,
      "text": "dan kepitlah tanganmu ke ketiakmu, niscaya ia ke luar menjadi putih (bercahaya) tanpa cacat, sebagai mukjizat yang lain,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2371,
      "text": "untuk Kami perlihatkan kepadamu (sebagian) dari tanda-tanda kebesaran Kami yang sangat besar.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2372,
      "text": "Pergilah kepada Fir'aun; dia benar-benar telah melampaui batas.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 270,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2373,
      "text": "Dia (Musa) berkata, \"Ya Tuhanku, lapangkanlah dadaku,[511]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2374,
      "text": "dan mudahkanlah untukku urusanku,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2375,
      "text": "dan lepaskanlah kekakuan dari lidahku,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2376,
      "text": "agar mereka mengerti perkataanku,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2377,
      "text": "dan jadikanlah untukku seorang pembantu dari keluargaku,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2378,
      "text": "(yaitu) Harun, saudaraku.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2379,
      "text": "Teguhkanlah kekuatanku dengan (keberadaan) dia,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2380,
      "text": "dan jadikanlah dia teman dalam urusanku,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2381,
      "text": "agar kami banyak bertasbih kepada-Mu,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2382,
      "text": "dan banyak mengingat-Mu,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2383,
      "text": "sesungguhnya Engkau Maha Melihat (keadaan) kami.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2384,
      "text": "Dia (Allah) berfirman, \"Sungguh, telah diperkenankan permintaanmu, wahai Musa!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2385,
      "text": "Dan sungguh, Kami telah memberi nikmat kepadamu pada kesempatan yang lain (sebelum ini),",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 313,
      "ruku": 271,
      "hizbQuarter": 125,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
